sequenceDiagram
    participant Scraper as Scraper Worker
    participant Browser as Browser Pool
    participant Page as Web Page
    participant Actions as Scraper Actions
    participant Webhook as Notification System

    Scraper->>Browser: Open Browser Page Context
    Browser-->>Scraper: Browser Page Instance
    
    Note over Scraper, Page: Initial Page Load
    Scraper->>Actions: Navigate to Web Page
    Actions-->>Scraper: Page Data & Assets
    
    Scraper->>Page: Get HTML Content
    Page-->>Scraper: HTML Content
    
    Scraper->>Page: Get Page Title
    Page-->>Scraper: Page Title
    
    Scraper->>Actions: Analyze Page for SEO
    Actions-->>Scraper: SEO Report
    
    Note over Scraper, Actions: Extract Data Based on Page Type
    alt Homepage
        Scraper->>Actions: Identify Internal Links
        Actions-->>Scraper: List of Links
    else Other Types of Pages
        Scraper->>Actions: Identify Page Type
        Actions-->>Scraper: Page Type & Metadata
        
        alt Paginated Product List
            loop While more pages exist
                Scraper->>Actions: Extract Products from Current Page
                Scraper->>Actions: Move to Next Page/Load More
            end
            Actions-->>Scraper: List of Products
        else Non-Paginated Product List
            Scraper->>Actions: Extract Product List
            Actions-->>Scraper: List of Products
        else Product Page
            Scraper->>Actions: Extract Product Details
            Actions-->>Scraper: Product Information
        else General Page
            Scraper->>Actions: Extract Page Text
            Actions-->>Scraper: Text Content
        end
    end

    Note over Scraper: Scraping Task Complete
    
    Scraper->>Webhook: Send Results to Webhook
    Webhook->>Webhook: Notify External System
